{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫小生、小花今晚為本月19日舉行的《萬千星輝賀台慶》拍攝序幕，更移師到九龍灣一條未通車的隧道內拍攝，眾人載歌載舞，當中張振朗、劉穎鏇、朱敏瀚、劉佩玥站在前排位置。</p><p>現場除了有多部名車，更出動航拍機拍攝，相當大陣仗。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T13:44:26.750406+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:09:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T13:37:41.605465+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T13:37:41.605465+00:00","content_hash":"77e6e2c1b6b7fa61d8f6957678d7aee7dc03c06df7b448659c1fdf932649f26b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}